      "line": 1753,
      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "variable": "parent->child_boxes, a",
      "state": "After the size check is violated, the same `a` object is still appended to `wave->child_boxes`, so the oversized `esds` survives as a registered child."
    },
    {
